cho(336, "That's the ______ dress. We don't have a cheaper one.", ["biggest","smallest","cheapest","longest"], 2, "没有更便宜的了，说明这件是最便宜的cheapest。本题考查形容词词义辨析和最高级。")
cho(337, "—______ are there in your family?\n—Three.", ["How many peoples","How much people","How many people"], 2, "people表示“人”时是集合名词，复数概念，不能加-s；how many接可数名词复数。故选C。")
cho(338, "Your book is ______ and I am so ______ in it.", ["interesting; interesting","interested; interested","interested, interesting","interesting, interested"], 3, "-ing结尾修饰物：你的书非常有趣，用interesting；-ed结尾修饰人：我对它很感兴趣，用interested。故答案选D。")
cho(339, "They feel ______ today.", ["happy","happily","badly"], 0, "系动词feel后应接形容词。感到开心feel happy。故选A。")
