cho(345, "I will buy the red pen, it is ______ than the green one.", ["cheaper","cheapper","cheapir"], 0, "考察形容词比较级的用法。cheap比较级cheaper。")
cho(346, "—Tony is a great football player.\n—Yes. And Jason can play football ______ him.", ["as good as","as well as","as bad as","as badly as"], 1, "修饰动词play用副词well，as well as和……一样好。")
cho(347, "______ bread did you eat?", ["How much","How many","How well"], 0, "How much对不可数名词提问。bread是不可数名词。故答案为A。")
cho(348, "\"He walks to school every day\". This means \"he ______ walks to school\".", ["often","usually","always"], 2, "每天走路去上学，所以频率很高用always。")
cho(349, "—Where shall we eat tonight?\n—Let's call Mike. He ______ knows the best places to go.", ["only","nearly","seldom","always"], 3, "only仅仅；nearly几乎不；seldom很少；always总是。他总是知道去哪里最好。故选D。")
fill(350, "The weather is ______ today.（sun）", "sunny", "此处描述天气，应填描述天气的形容词，sun相应的形容词为sunny。")
cho(351, "Among the students, Sally made the ______ mistakes in the exams on February 2nd, 2017.", ["fewer","fewest","less","least"], 1, "mistake是可数名词，排除C和D；所有人当中犯错最少用最高级fewest。故答案选B。")
cho(352, "This apple is ______ big to eat.", ["too much","too many","too","many"], 2, "too + adj. to 太…以至于。")
fill(353, "It's 29 ℃. It's ______ （热的）.", "hot", "hot意为“热的”。")
