cho(355, "I'm ______ than my friend, Jim.", ["short","shortest","shorter","the shortest"], 2, "than前面用比较级，表示“比……更……”。short比较级形式为shorter。")
cho(356, "The Yangtze River is one of ______ in the world.", ["the longest river","longer river","the longest rivers","longer rivers"], 2, "三个或三个以上比较用最高级；one of后接名词复数。故选C。")
cho(357, "My sister ______ a blog.", ["sometimes write","sometimes writes","write sometimes"], 1, "频率副词位于实义动词之前，实义动词三单需变形。故选B。")
cho(358, "Eat your food ______ , please. You don't need to hurry!", ["slow","slowly","quick"], 1, "修饰动词eat用副词slowly。句意：请慢点吃东西。")
cho(359, "The more exercise you take, ______ you will be.", ["healthier","happier","the healthier","the weaker"], 2, "The+比较级..., the+比较级...。你锻炼的越多，就会越健康。所以选C。")
cho(360, "Pandas are ______ .", ["blue and black","white and yellow","white and black"], 2, "熊猫是黑白相间的，white and black。故选C。")
cho(361, "The film is very ______ .", ["interesting","interested","interest"], 0, "事物作主语用interesting修饰。")
cho(362, "He found a phrase book and read it ______ .", ["slow","to be slow","slowly","being slow"], 2, "副词slowly用于修饰动词read，表示一种程度。")
cho(363, "There must be ______ with the machine. It cannot work.", ["something wrong","wrong something","anything wrong","wrong anything"], 0, "形容词修饰复合不定代词后置；肯定句用something。故选A。")
cho(364, "Today is very ______ . I want to go swimming.", ["rainy","hot","windy"], 1, "根据后半句go swimming可知天气应该挺热的，故应该选B。")
cho(365, "Mike is ______ than me. He is the ______ in our class.", ["tall; taller","tallest; taller","taller; tallest"], 2, "Mike比我高用比较级taller；他是我们班最高的用最高级tallest。选C。")
cho(366, "I swim ______ , but she swims ______ .", ["badly; well","good; badly","bad; well","well; bad"], 0, "动词后接副词。我游泳游得很差badly，但她游得很好well。故答案选A。")
cho(367, "—The cake looks ______ .\n—Yes, and it tastes even ______ .", ["well; good","good; better","good; worse","better; best"], 1, "看起来很棒用good；尝起来甚至更棒用比较级better。故选B。")
cho(368, "In summer, the sun rises early and sets ______ .", ["quick","early","late","high"], 2, "考查副词。句意：夏天，太阳很早就升起来了，很晚才落下。故选C。")
cho(369, "Tom is ______ than Jack. But I am the ______ of the three.", ["short; shortest","shorter; shortest","short; the shortest"], 1, "两者之间用比较级shorter；三个中最矮的用最高级shortest。故选B。")
cho(370, "This rice is ______ hot to eat.", ["too much","too many","too","many more"], 2, "too + adj. + to。")

